#page_body
  .column_container
    .column.bg_vlightpurple.w_560
      %p.red.font18.bold.center
        Pinball Map API Token
      - if @api_token.nil? || @api_token.denied? || @api_token.revoked?
        %p
          Starting in 2026, all API requests must include an
          %span.bold api_token
          parameter. See this
          = link_to "blog post", "https://blog.pinballmap.com/2026/07/16/api-tokens/"
          for more details.
        %p== By requesting a token, you are confirming that your app adheres to the #{link_to "data use agreement", "/faq#data-usage"}, includes attribution (if applicable, to the exact location(s) you're showing), and will not clone Pinball Map's functionality (hint: if your app contains some variation of, "find places to play pinball" then it's likely unnecessary and you should point people to us instead).
        %p
          After being granted a token, it may be revoked if you do not make smart decisions. Server resources are not infinite. See the
          = link_to "docs", apipie_apipie_path
          and see the
          = link_to "llms.txt", "/llms.txt"
          file for tips. Do not make thousands of unnecessary requests.
        - if user_signed_in?
          %p
            Describe your planned use of the API below.
            %span.bold Include details such as the name of your service, a link to it, a description of what it does, and which endpoints you are planning to use and how often you'll be hitting them.
            Imagine that we will use the text of your request to identify, understand, and track usage forever after, with no further information needed. Most requests that are denied are because they're simply missing info. If you are denied, you can try again, but we might not hold your hand describing exactly what further info is desired. It's a really simple request, and you can save us all time by putting in the effort.
          - if @api_token&.denied?
            %p.red
              Your previous request was not approved. You may not have included the details described above. Feel free to submit a new one with more detail.
          - elsif @api_token&.revoked?
            %p.red
              Your API token access has been revoked. Contact us if you think this is a mistake. Or, if you understand why, you can submit a request for a new one with a revised plan.
          #api_token_maker.pb_10
            = form_tag api_token_path, method: :post do
              %ul.pl_0
                %li.msg.h_auto
                  %label{for: "api_token_requested_use"} Planned use:
                  %textarea{name: "api_token[requested_use]", id: "api_token_requested_use", class: "text w_400", required: true}
                %li.submit{style: "clear:both;"}
                  %input{type: "submit", value: "Request API Token", class: "submit_button"}
        - else
          %p.red== To request a token you first need to #{link_to 'login', new_user_session_path, :class => "red bold"}. Thank you!
      - elsif @api_token.pending?
        %p
          Your API token request is pending review. We'll email you once it's been approved (check your spam or, better yet, whitelist admin@pinballmap.com!).
      - elsif @api_token.active?
        %p
          Your API token:
        %p.center
          %code= @api_token.token
        %p
          Include this as the
          %span.bold api_token
          parameter (or
          %span.bold X-Api-Token
          header) on your API requests.
        #api_token_regenerate.pb_10
          = form_tag regenerate_api_token_path, method: :post do
            %p
              If your token has been compromised, you can regenerate it. Your old token will stop working immediately.
            %input{type: "submit", value: "Regenerate Token", class: "submit_button"}
